      "text": "A function (req, res, next). It either sends a response (chain ends) or calls next()\n(continue).",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A function (req, res, next). It either sends a response (chain ends) or calls next()\n(continue).",
