      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795239050963,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What await does with a Promise:\n- fulfilled  →  await returns the value\n- rejected   →  await THROWS the error on that line\n\nSo try/catch can only catch a rejection if the try\nis still running when the rejection happens.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What await does with a Promise:\n- fulfilled  →  await returns the value\n- rejected   →  await THROWS the error on that line\n\nSo try/catch can only catch a rejection if the try\nis still running when the rejection happens.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b02"
    },
