      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795161628189,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. The throw becomes a REJECTED\npromise. Only a .catch() or Express\ncan receive it.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "tl3",
      "originalText": "4. The throw becomes a REJECTED\npromise. Only a .catch() or Express\ncan receive it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0E"
    },
    {
      "id": "tl-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1720,
      "width": 1188,
      "height": 22,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#555555",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 536170607,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1078282033,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795161628189,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key idea: the throw happens AFTER the try has finished. That is why a plain try/catch around the call cannot see it.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key idea: the throw happens AFTER the try has finished. That is why a plain try/catch around the call cannot see it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0F"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1780,
      "width": 1018,
      "height": 33,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1529349478,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1190838367,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795161628189,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3.  Express middleware: the request pipeline and the error branch",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3.  Express middleware: the request pipeline and the error branch",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0G"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-intro",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1830,
      "width": 1096,
      "height": 43,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#555555",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1361560213,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1264007441,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795161628189,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each middleware is a function (req, res, next). It either responds (chain ends) or calls next() (continue).\nGreen arrows = next().  Red arrows = next(err).",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each middleware is a function (req, res, next). It either responds (chain ends) or calls next() (continue).\nGreen arrows = next().  Red arrows = next(err).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0H"
    },
