      "text": "Example B: an unknown user (the bug path)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Example B: an unknown user (the bug path)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b17"
    },
    {
      "id": "exB-b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 958,
      "y": 2945,
      "width": 751,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 10422692,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1652997055,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795161628189,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1  express.json() → req.body = { email, password } (both present)\n2  Passes the field check\n3  UserModel.findOne(...) has NO await → isExists is a Query object (truthy)\n4  if (!isExists) → false, so 'user not found' is never thrown\n5  bcrypt.compareSync(pw, isExists.password) → password is undefined → throws\n6  Same catch path: asyncHandler → next(err) → errorMiddleware\n7  Response:  500  { success: false, message: <bcrypt argument error text> }\nExpected: 404 'user not found'.  Fix: const isExists = await UserModel.findOne(...)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1  express.json() → req.body = { email, password } (both present)\n2  Passes the field check\n3  UserModel.findOne(...) has NO await → isExists is a Query object (truthy)\n4  if (!isExists) → false, so 'user not found' is never thrown\n5  bcrypt.compareSync(pw, isExists.password) → password is undefined → throws\n6  Same catch path: asyncHandler → next(err) → errorMiddleware\n7  Response:  500  { success: false, message: <bcrypt argument error text> }\nExpected: 404 'user not found'.  Fix: const isExists = await UserModel.findOne(...)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b18"
    },
