      "text": "try/catch → res.status(400) bypasses the global handler. Even a DB outage\nbecomes 400 'Something went wrong'. Fix: next(err) instead.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "try/catch → res.status(400) bypasses the global handler. Even a DB outage\nbecomes 400 'Something went wrong'. Fix: next(err) instead.",
